    <item>
      <title>0.2.0</title>
      <pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 02:14:43 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>2</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[
<h3>新功能</h3>
<ul>
<li><b>自动更新</b>：每天自动检查一次新版本，有更新时输入法菜单里会出现「有新版本」；也可以在「设置 → 关于」里点「检查更新…」。更新包有 EdDSA 签名校验，安装时需要输入管理员密码</li>
<li>「设置 → 关于」可以关掉自动检查</li>
</ul>
<h3>说明</h3>
<ul>
<li>0.1.0 没有自动更新功能，这一次需要手动下载安装；从 0.2.0 开始，以后的版本都会自动提示</li>
<li>联网说明：自动检查只下载一个很小的版本信息文件，不上传任何东西</li>
</ul>
      ]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/yihuashub/haoyong-releases/releases/download/v0.2.0/Haoyong-0.2.0.pkg" sparkle:installationType="package" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="lYOxwxM04pRl25mnd4OEg3wS6j2S47sHkWh61p2Z+F8yMdDU1T8I/uN1QMGym+LTMsoCnv3UBmbLr8BLjffwAQ==" length="34226757"/>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>0.2.1</title>
      <pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 04:04:24 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>3</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[
<h3>修复</h3>
<ul>
<li>在全新的 Mac 上装完以后，输入法菜单、「系统设置 › 键盘 › 输入法」里都找不到 haoyong 拼音。原因是安装时只启用了简体模式，没有启用输入法本身。现在两者都会启用。</li>
<li>安装时 macOS 可能会问是否允许 haoyong，点「允许」即可。</li>
</ul>
<p>如果你装过 0.2.0 却一直找不到它，重新下载 0.2.1 安装一次就好。</p>
      ]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/yihuashub/haoyong-releases/releases/download/v0.2.1/Haoyong-0.2.1.pkg" sparkle:installationType="package" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="OPBHJrFG5XkoOKEwZRyQcql12IGii9ycVn2TY+9u+PHqehzh0fw+MNrPV1qOkFJaVG3IBCWMJmWnERnHX8nvDg==" length="34229953"/>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>0.2.2</title>
      <pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 16:53:05 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>4</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[
<h3>改名</h3>
<p>haoyong 输入法改叫「好用输入法」，输入法列表里叫「好用拼音」。学习记录、设置和同步都不受影响。</p>
<h3>新功能</h3>
<ul>
<li>菜单栏显示今天打了多少字，点开能看平均速度和累计字数。只在本机记数字，不记内容、不同步。不想要可以在菜单里或设置里关掉。</li>
<li>设置「关于」页可以直接卸载，可以选择保留学习记录。</li>
</ul>
<h3>修复</h3>
<ul>
<li>从输入法菜单打开设置时，窗口会被压在其他窗口下面，现在会出现在最前面。</li>
<li>纠错候选后面的小魔法棒在浅色皮肤上几乎看不见，现在颜色加深了。</li>
</ul>
      ]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/yihuashub/haoyong-releases/releases/download/v0.2.2/Haoyong-0.2.2.pkg" sparkle:installationType="package" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="3DqNd8g6fR5k03P9b25A1fic4gYOpwgaOLCchpphaDN2dLVCQ5nBNSszo8Abqy3gAxcgdPWto1Cjim5+UTc0Ag==" length="34273157"/>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>0.2.3</title>
      <pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 03:30:40 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>5</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.3</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[
<h3>修复</h3>
<ul>
<li>在 Chrome 的登录框、两步验证码框里完全打不了字（按什么都没反应）。原因是输入法把自己声明成「只能打中文」，浏览器的安全输入框因此把按键全丢掉了。</li>
</ul>
<p>装完如果在这些输入框里还是打不了字，注销再登录一次 macOS，让系统重新读取输入法信息。</p>
      ]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/yihuashub/haoyong-releases/releases/download/v0.2.3/Haoyong-0.2.3.pkg" sparkle:installationType="package" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="7VZfr0wMiUXom+b7FB2KA0faTqTLxIxnPXegk1+zhYBSNsZnIjrpRoTo9FhkCqC+/Z1hnoPVxt7AjaYWgPdzBw==" length="34273515"/>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>0.2.4</title>
      <pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 10:16:31 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>6</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.4</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[
<h3>改进</h3>
<ul>
<li>模糊音默认关闭。以前平翘舌、n/l、前后鼻音默认全开，打 shan 首选会变成「上」「三」，「shan wan le ma」出来的是「上网了吗」，「删完了吗」排不进前五。现在打什么拼音就先出什么字。</li>
<li>分不清这几组音的话，可以在「设置 › 通用 › 模糊音」里分别打开。</li>
</ul>
      ]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/yihuashub/haoyong-releases/releases/download/v0.2.4/Haoyong-0.2.4.pkg" sparkle:installationType="package" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="evP+cHikHVjpPtmxo9E7suau+fqYzOvJt6Z8XuoEG1P2YDdMKHNV1qUjaQBvi92AlpdHKnXCAUl4cKvyEzVMBg==" length="34275966"/>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>0.2.5</title>
      <pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 10:35:10 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>7</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.5</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[
<h3>改进</h3>
<ul>
<li>切换输入法时显示的图标换成「h|」。早期版本用过「好」字图标，系统会缓存，装过的机器切换时可能还看到「好」，现在不会了。</li>
<li>设置里语法模型的说明更新成新的评测结果：整句首选 88.8% → 91.8%。</li>
</ul>
      ]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/yihuashub/haoyong-releases/releases/download/v0.2.5/Haoyong-0.2.5.pkg" sparkle:installationType="package" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="GNi2kxnWyURbJYXX5rcpU1vb1siv5k/jydf76TXe3m2GqMG3SXEY0u8yk2TQgt/egyA4EI2t79mLw/S0Ip+BDQ==" length="34275906"/>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>0.2.6</title>
      <pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 18:44:05 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>8</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.6</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[
<ul>
<li>切换到好用拼音时，光标旁的提示改成不带底的 h|，并且居中；不会再显示旧的「好」（安装时会刷新系统的提示缓存）</li>
<li>按 Shift 切中英时，「英」的提示看得清了（之前在跟随系统深浅色的皮肤里是一整块黑），「中」「英」都用高亮色</li>
</ul>
      ]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/yihuashub/haoyong-releases/releases/download/v0.2.6/Haoyong-0.2.6.pkg" sparkle:installationType="package" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="+Ur9QlTFgTXgynFdnnRREL3F32qjiYTmwUutKH2tgF0DN2E14nu1E08YV4cQa9N353EQNDI/kU7PeaenvN6iCg==" length="34279176"/>
    </item>
